# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-M47E5.1`.
#
# `env -u ...` because a dispatch leaks its run id and home into subprocesses;
# these are pure predicate tests but the drivers binary is shared with tests
# that boot their own state, and the rule is uniform. The `--skip` is the one
# `orgasmic verify` requires of anything touching the drivers suite.
#
# TWO tests, one per worktree-derived guess the move invalidated. The finalize
# one is the defect the task names: with the worktree outside the project, a
# summary file in the project's dispatch dir is refused. The second is the
# other half — with no configured project root, the old code invented one from
# `worktree.parent()`, which after the move names the managed worktree root.
# A test that only asserted "in-worktree summary files still work" could see
# neither: that path never went through the broken predicate.
#
# Both positional filters go after `--`, following `--skip` and its value.
# libtest ORs any number of positional filters; cargo takes only one.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-drivers --lib -- --skip legacy_drivers_and_explicit_pairs_emit_equivalent_start_events finalize_accepts_a_dispatch_dir_summary_file_from_an_out_of_project_worktree a_dispatch_artifact_grant_refuses_when_no_project_root_is_configured
